    "diagnostic-show-accessible-tree": "command://diagnostics/show-accessible-tree is Availability::Internal (no Shortcut flag), so it may not have a key in shortcuts v2; a developer command",
    "help": "no command with this function: \"help\" was a UiAction (Context sensitive help, F1) with no handler and no ActionToCommand row even in the old tree; the current tree has no context-sensitive-help command (only command://app/online-handbook and command://app/ask-help, which are different features)",
    "multiwindows-dev-show-info": "command://multiwindows/dev/show-info is Availability::Internal (no Shortcut flag), so it may not have a key in shortcuts v2; a developer command",
    "nav-dev-show-controls": "no command with this function: the old DEV_SHOW_CONTROLS_URI (muse://devtools/keynav/controls) was never wired to a command (unused constant in muse/framework/ui/internal/navigationcontroller.cpp:57); no navigation command or compat entry exists for it in the current tree",
    "omr": "only present inside an XML comment in all three 4.7 key files (OMR feature removed); no command",
    "string-above": "same function as pitch-up: in v2 both command://notation/goto-string-above and command://notation/pitch-up call NotationActionController::move() (notationactioncontroller.cpp:236, :394), and Up/Down are bound to pitch-up/down; a 4.7 key change of this code is not carried over",
    "string-below": "same function as pitch-down: in v2 both command://notation/goto-string-below and command://notation/pitch-down call NotationActionController::move() (notationactioncontroller.cpp:236, :394), and Up/Down are bound to pitch-up/down; a 4.7 key change of this code is not carried over"
  },
  "scopes": {
